            {
                "comment": "Solid state with Prof. Brar is a blast! He tends to talk very fast in lecture but posts his notes online. The homework is weighted heavily enough that you shouldn't have to worry too much if you get a bad exam grade and there is a fair amount of extra credit offered. He's also very accessible and helpful outside of class if you ever need help.",
